js:
1. quotes: \x27single\x27 \x22double\x22
2. script end and comment: \x3C/script\x3E\x3C!--x--\x3E
3. an entity, decoded in an attribute: \x26#39;
4. backslash, line feed, carriage return: a\\b\nc\rd
5. line and paragraph separators: a\u2028b\u2029c
6. cyrillic is kept: тест
7. a broken utf-8 sequence does not hide a quote: escaped